{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4374227cdeaea18d896670ccd466bd77105e867b47445494c67258a753b769fb", "ja": "（アイドル達が一丸となって、交響曲を演奏する、\n春の野外音楽フェス……その本番が近づいている）", "zh": "（偶像们齐心协力演奏交响曲的春季户外音乐节……正式演出越来越近了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1001_p", "source_sha256": "752a13075abbe7635868a31a03b380a1ab39a4e5c90ddb503d3ab611d34ed536", "ja": "（指揮者をする瑞希のリクエストで、今日は\nコンサートの見学。瑞希の勉強になったかな？）", "zh": "（应担任指挥家的瑞希的请求，今天来参观音乐会。对瑞希来说，应该也算是学习吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "ebce86b607dc0146371bb24c3ea19dffb59d0edc02d3438001746135b71d85c6", "ja": "すばらしい演奏でした。\nぱちぱちぱち……スタンディングオベーション。", "zh": "精彩绝伦的演奏。\n啪啪啪……起立鼓掌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3c6729e91eff1b481ec35727fb46265f27d2259e982b93dbb7f894c0a8e2e717", "ja": "どうだ？　公演の参考にはなりそうか？", "zh": "怎么样？对公演的参考有帮助吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "3935b3c9d22910fa9214327abd9133e7e25ec1f4f9376441b900cdd94f4ad949", "ja": "はい。おかげさまで、指揮者の方の動きを、\n隅々まで見る事ができました……じっくり。", "zh": "是的。多亏了您，我得以将指挥家的动作观察得一清二楚……仔仔细细地。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "dec4207a24690b3fde0cf81e2fff05f2eba03906569ca27f55553df701ccf3b8", "ja": "お辞儀をする時の間の取り方も、\nタクトの振り方も、完璧です。", "zh": "连鞠躬时的停顿把握，以及挥动指挥棒的方式，也都无可挑剔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "fff5b9895377397518437c9c3e9b77844415fe2076c3c423e2177a8318add9ad", "ja": "指揮は、半端な覚悟ではできません。\n私も全力で挑まなくては……ぼっ。", "zh": "指挥可不是抱着半吊子的觉悟就能做到的。\n我也必须全力以赴才行……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1007_p", "source_sha256": "16eccfb6b7a6586db00b9baf05853c2147aa41774e9e5fa8175cebd85b6b800d", "ja": "おお、ずいぶん燃えてるな！", "zh": "哦，干劲十足啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "97f2e5dd07e3d6971b20fdb9d86f24bd279a877d2c0c5dcf3cb0d85c3149ad12", "ja": "私が指揮をするみなさんは、\nひとりひとりが、魅力的なアイドルです。", "zh": "在我指挥下的各位，\n每一个人，都是魅力十足的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "73a1582fc271766153902f6c7416ffa52accea2a6a614a27b1c8aa253399c5c2", "ja": "幻想的な、七尾さんのバイオリン。\n努力の音色、高山さんのコントラバス……etc。", "zh": "七尾同学那如幻似真般的小提琴。\n高山同学那透着努力音色的低音提琴……等等。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "718b60b5802fda9deb98ee91b319be3e429985ed9f7ed4cfc46beccea11f925d", "ja": "そんなみなさんをまとめるには、私にも\n熱量が必要です……はい。情熱の指揮者、瑞希です。", "zh": "要把大家凝聚起来，我也需要热情……没错。我是激情的指挥家，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1aa5ce95388b93e39af939f2dbd4a18d1416494a99cc920e55cc491125bcb957", "ja": "みんな個性的だもんな。\nなんとなくわかるよ。プロデュースしていると。", "zh": "大家确实都很有个性啊。\n作为制作人，我多少也能明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "61c80025547646cb54b999928151203aaa37a46b411a8368db8e581bdc07c3c7", "ja": "なるほど……考えてみると、\n指揮とプロデュースは、似ているかもしれません。", "zh": "原来如此……仔细想想，\n指挥和制作，或许确实有些相似。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "e015189168b74e67b0f93110cb609defa7bc754b6669e3e8be6f2ab84cf0a673", "ja": "私は1回でも大変なのに。{$P$}は\nいつもこれをしているんですね……すごい。", "zh": "我就算做1次也很辛苦了。{$P$}一直都在做这种事呢……真厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1014_p", "source_sha256": "60921f937dbfcd7b04bb8441969759152d78621106c0f3205bc1d9ea3a343c74", "ja": "いやいや、俺なんか全然。\n本当に凄いのは、アイドルのみんなだから。", "zh": "哪里哪里，我这点本事根本不算什么。\n真正厉害的是偶像们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "10886efa16d81723b3d9eec4011eac20aed4607253a454ae6bcf98fd3301e49f", "ja": "確かに、みなさんも凄いです。しかし、その凄さを\n活かす{$P$}も……すごいかと。", "zh": "确实，大家也都很厉害。但是，能将那份厉害\n发挥出来的{$P$}……也很厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "793fdcf84dbd63f6d22bc011e93561137a162ddebf6b5b025e22e7eb0e565a45", "ja": "私も、みなさんの個性を活かす指揮、\n頑張らなくては……むむん。", "zh": "我也必须努力做好发挥大家个性的指挥工作才行……嗯嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1017_p", "source_sha256": "be92492dabae722f5ce39832fddc67ffe9ab8d3180e80cabcd247a9c8b99a647", "ja": "個性を活かす、か……確かに大事だな。\nよし、本番を期待しているぞ！", "zh": "发挥个性吗……确实很重要啊。\n好，我期待你在正式演出中的表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "2642753dd94d8e5912d032da49d90ac04e8c9a4a7fd6a72d8e6a32f9e10f39a0", "ja": "{$P$}……はい。\n期待に応えます……燃え盛るぞ、瑞希。ぼぼぼっ。", "zh": "{$P$}……好的。\n我会回应您的期待……燃烧起来吧，瑞希。呼呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0233_1019_p", "source_sha256": "323f94c0b062fd81cf0d2bf3333a0052bfbf05d0c6a3bd0f3e1c2e6a05b27d9d", "ja": "（指揮者として大切な事、瑞希にはもうわかっている\nみたいだ。しっかりこなしてくれそうだな！）", "zh": "（作为指挥家重要的事情，瑞希似乎已经明白了。感觉她会好好完成的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
